# FixFlags UI

Before editing UI, read `/AGENTS.md`, `.ui-craft/brief.md`, `lib/design/tokens.css`, and `DESIGN.md`.

## Stack

Tailwind + shadcn. Use semantic tokens (`bg-card`, `text-brand`, `shadow-card`, `rounded-card`), never raw hex except `grade.*`.

## Color

60% paper (`background`, mesh canvas) · 30% ink (`foreground`, `primary`) · 10% brand orange (`brand`). One accent per surface. Dark mode: neutral gray canvas + subtle warm orbs (see `tokens.css` `.dark`).

## Depth

Shadow-first. Cards: `border-0 shadow-card glass-surface`. Sections: `bg-muted/35`, not `border-y`. Borders only on inputs and table rows.

## Type

`font-sans` body · `font-serif`/`font-display` (Fraunces) for marketing headlines only · `font-mono` + `section-label` for uppercase labels. `text-balance` headings, `text-pretty` body, `tabular-nums` on numbers. Never serif on dense report UI.

## Layout

Report pages: `Container variant="report"` (`max-w-6xl`). Marketing: `default` (`max-w-5xl`). Marketing full mesh (`GlobalMeshBackdrop intensity="full"`) has no hero grid.

## Radius

Concentric: inner = outer − padding. Cards/panels: `rounded-card` (~27px from `--radius-card`). Controls: `rounded-full` (pill).

## Anti-slop

No icon grids, gradient heroes, colored trend pills, `transition: all`, or default blue/Inter stacks. Sentence case. Real product screenshots over illustrations.

## Polish

`active:scale-[0.96]` on buttons · layered shadows · `prefers-reduced-motion` · focus rings on `--ring` · 44×44px min hit targets (`min-h-11 min-w-11`).
